WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:0
Aces, kings, queens and jacks score: 16 in all.
Napoleon and a secret partner must reach the bid.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:21.000 line:0
North bids 9♥ and everyone passes:
hearts are trumps; the target is nine point cards.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.999 line:0
Napoleon takes the two kitty cards and discards two.

00:00:29.999 --> 00:00:34.998 line:0
Four-player discards are shown; the others confirm.

00:00:34.998 --> 00:00:43.998 line:0
North names the ♠A as the secretary card:
its holder is a hidden partner until it is played.

00:00:43.998 --> 00:00:50.498 line:0
North leads trump 2: the big joker must be played.

00:00:50.498 --> 00:00:58.998 line:0
East plays the ♠A and is revealed as secretary;
the secretary card is highest and wins.

00:00:58.998 --> 00:01:13.997 line:0
Fast-forward through the remaining tricks;
name plates count each seat’s point cards.

00:01:13.997 --> 00:01:23.000 line:0
Napoleon and the secretary take 13, beating nine:
they win together.
